      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "5x + 6x = 110 => 11x = 110 => x = 10. Smallest = 5x = 50.",
      "hash": "ffaac21fdda558ce",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का अनुपात 5:6 है। यदि योग 110 है, तो छोटी संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "40",
            "B": "50",
            "C": "60",
            "D": "70"
          },
          "explanation": "5x + 6x = 110 => 11x = 110 => x = 10। छोटी = 5x = 50."
        }
      }
